    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9754f9586b96ab475e5334",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一般来说，不惧怕、不迷惘，无所畏惧\n前进的坚强意志，就是“勇气”的概念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3ddb43efe09284c077e21bf170917f636f97c53b5b9afd398e590eb3371e5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
