      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……理解了“获得勇气”的意思。\n所以，正因如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca154201a930a1e05bc2516b7ad40e37b269d8ff62bc5b5271476916e2375428",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
