    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68b84aa4adf0eef9243b1cef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "判断肉体需要更多强化。\n将立刻进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9bd29f42a35cd5da011faa8a32847d1c2390593ed669b3e9f694bcab636de9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f7ba9c956d09156a176ef6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那一天的训练，\n美浦波旁比过去的任何时候都来得更加认真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe9720a2b6b0bb4c19c5de4987765d0f15206aa9a8785dc437627ca956e5105",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecc2bf92ddc3830fb6513013",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练结束后。\n我因为忘了拿东西而返回操场──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf00b60f9244957864f1eabb221d1be6462135fb21cdbf8cc93caeed16ebcbb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a5f9469982760930c4abd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她还在跑！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8459303bbe47f521d6ea4b43d37770b414ddb0a0963ef10741a04405fdc4e84e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
