    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd66cc06ba2ba3d44abf288",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ebfebdaf1aad8f3c9a6b0ce510a7e48e7d98beeed5195167049ee29ff5aa4ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ca56ffdf4718cb5515851c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喝、喝、喝……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de702d406d4124073ab40b420ac657791804938ea607ed1e99abeed4b73db3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0131a22905eeb63dfb2bce81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王还有“帝王”这个别称，\n是前年的二冠赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "789fa26caad95347cb910fb444010dbc6d13529a376267c4a809ae067ce488f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87bfc523b02747bcaf2e10df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对她的体力感到相当佩服。\n但待会就是门禁时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0034c0f15d1ac8b4ea206bc397d774c8d75482a410c3b5d1188ab394d187f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d1a785673145d605cd6a12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正当我打算开口同时──\n另一个声音抢在我的前面出现。",
